Their inputs are synthetic: src/testref.rs and examples/record_refs draw every picture and generate every sound with plain arithmetic, so no recorded picture or sound is in them. examples/record_refs made them; run `cargo run --release --example record_refs -- vp9` to make them again. manifest.toml gives, for every file and reference, its sha256, the tool and version that made it and the exact command.

Tools:
- pito-codecs 3.0.0
- vp9    - WebM Project VP9 Decoder v1.17.0
- vp9    - WebM Project VP9 Encoder v1.17.0 (default)
